      {
        "id": 201580,
        "name": "Chaosmancer",
        "username": "Chaosmancer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/chaosmancer/{size}/1977_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-08-11T18:37:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I can think of wanting defense in the forest if you are playing with Heart of the Wildfire, but that would be too late for presence placement unless another power was allowing more presence to be placed after the spirit phase.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But, that's the best I can come up with off the top of my head. Something is damaging the land that isn't invaders ravaging.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Edit: Looked through my cards, was mixing Shadows of the Burning Forest with Dark and Tangled Woods.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Yeah, I have no idea why this doesn't say target a land with invaders. Typo holdover from when the card used to do something else?</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:30:07.200Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 1,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.2,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 17021,
        "topic_slug": "shadows-of-the-burning-forest",
        "display_username": "Chaosmancer",
        "primary_group_name": null,
        "flair_name": null,
        "flair_url": null,
        "flair_bg_color": null,
        "flair_color": null,
        "flair_group_id": null,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
